# Vuforia bootstrap tarball (132MB, embedded as a local package dependency) -
# too large for the repo; keep it locally in Packages/ so Unity can resolve
# com.ptc.vuforia.engine, but don't track it in git.
Packages/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-*.tgz
